OL,3,AMan arrested after Swiss rave shooting
OL,4,Athat killed woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 43-year-old Swiss man has been
OL,7,Farrested following the shooting at a
OL,8,Frave in Switzerland on Sunday.
OL,10,FThe arrest comes after a 22-year-old
OL,11,FItalian woman Maria Spinelli was killed
OL,12,Fand several others injured at a techno
OL,13,Frave being held at a horse racing track
OL,14,Fin Aarau, a town about 46km (29 miles)
OL,15,Fwest of Zurich.
OL,17,FThe shooting initiated a nearly 24-hour
OL,18,Fmanhunt before Aarau canton police
OL,19,Fconfirmed they apprehended the suspect
OL,20,Fshortly before 01:00 on Monday (23:00
OL,21,FGMT on Sunday).
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
